WEBVTT

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:39.600
Lao Li,

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:42.080
tell everyone to stay safe in battle.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:43.979
Follow orders in all actions.

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.240
Yes, Captain.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:55.960
Baozi,

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:58.600
your mission this time is very important.

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.160
Whether you can destroy the airport

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.560
is crucial to stopping the Japanese

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:02.760
from air-raiding Hangu Pass,

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:06.280
and will greatly reduce the pressure on allied forces at the front line.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.800
So the risks you face are also huge.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.250
You must be careful.

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:12.650
You don't need to worry.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:15.720
Adjutant Zhu has gone to contact the Eighth Route Army's main force.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.780
By then we'll attack from both sides,

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:20.370
and we'll definitely win a complete victory.

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:22.840
It's you who must pay attention to safety.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:25.160
There are many Japanese soldiers in Hama Cave.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.320
If your plan is delayed,

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.520
your retreat will be cut off by Japanese reinforcements.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.480
You could all be wiped out.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:34.560
Don't worry.

00:02:35.079 --> 00:02:36.610
Lao Xu, Yuanshangfei, and I

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.570
have made ample preparations.

00:02:39.079 --> 00:02:41.840
We are bound to win this battle.

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:45.480
Brothers,

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:46.960
are you all ready?

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:48.600
Ready.

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:53.640
Let's set off.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:56.040
Miss, is your gun ready?

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.480
Of course it's ready.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:58.840
Do you take me for a three-year-old?

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.280
I am the vice-captain now.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.120
How could I make such a rookie mistake?

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:03.160
I didn't mean that.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.880
I mean... Then what did you mean?

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:06.800
Lao Yuan is just joking with you.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:08.320
I know.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.200
I'm just teasing him.

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.720
Let's part ways here.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:27.000
Take care, everyone.

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:36.800
Let's go.

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:44.480
It is now the critical moment to fight hard.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.800
My dear comrades.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.660
I hope after the final battle,

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:50.240
we still have a chance

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.640
to meet again.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.480
Hurry up. Keep up.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:03:59.680
Hurry up. Quick.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.720
Quick.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:04.760
Quick.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:07.300
Report, Major.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.000
The gold has been refined.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:10.840
Good.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:12.200
Except for the sentries,

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:13.840
gather all the soldiers here.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:14.920
I want the gold transported away

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.520
as quickly as possible.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.400
Yes.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:20.080
What about the other thing

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:20.840
I asked you to do?

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:21.920
I have already cleared

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.160
a path for you in the back mountain,

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:24.360
just in case.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:25.520
Good.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:27.560
Strengthen security. Load the trucks immediately.

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:28.360
Yes.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:29.810
Load the trucks!

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:33.240
Hurry!

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.680
Master Liu, it's about time.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:41.760
We should make our move.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:42.480
Okay.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:44.460
Brothers, grab your weapons.

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.080
Let's go.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:46.159
Let's go.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.040
Brothers, stay hidden.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:56.440
Oh no.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.200
That old ghost Tahara Masao

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.400
moved up the gold transport operation.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:05.480
This is troublesome.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.760
We can't launch a sneak attack like this,

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.640
let alone snatch their weapons.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.320
They shouldn't have discovered our intentions yet.

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.000
We still have a chance to seize the initiative.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:14.560
So,

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.200
now we'll wait for Cui Wenpei and the others

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.600
to fire the first shot of the attack,

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:18.930
and then we'll rush out.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:20.290
When the time comes,

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.680
we'll take out the Japs in the nearby watchtowers

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:25.080
and eliminate the enemy's machine gun nests.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:27.280
Okay, we'll listen to you.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.120
Brothers, get ready.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:30.600
Everyone get to work,

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.800
and wait for Xu's orders at any time.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:33.720
Fall back.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.840
Brothers, follow me.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:54.720
We'll split up.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:57.400
You take out those heavy machine guns first.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:06:59.680
I'll lead the rest to charge from the front.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:00.440
Okay.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:02.120
You guys, come with me.

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:08.840
Follow me.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.240
Hurry up.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:16.840
Quick.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.320
Stop!

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.320
This is it.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.520
Baozi,

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.159
when are the Eighth Route Army reinforcements arriving?

00:07:37.159 --> 00:07:38.560
With their fire support,

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.540
we'd have nothing to worry about.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:43.380
But there's not a single soul in sight right now.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.120
Did Adjutant Zhu run into trouble on the way

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.280
and fail to deliver the message?

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:53.520
No, we can't wait.

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:55.560
It's past the agreed time.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.280
We can't miss the opportunity.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:00.210
The fighting at Toad Cave probably already started.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.120
Have you decided?

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:04.560
What are you hesitating for?

00:08:04.840 --> 00:08:05.720
Before we left,

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.560
Wenpei specifically told me

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.020
to keep an eye on you

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.220
so you won't take unnecessary risks.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.480
Can you stop me?

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:19.240
Since I promised Wenpei,

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:20.440
I have to keep my word.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:22.610
But this airport

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:24.480
isn't just for transport.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.000
If we don't destroy it,

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.640
it will be filled with Japanese bombers.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:30.640
So I thought,

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:32.280
to ensure your safety

00:08:32.679 --> 00:08:34.409
while destroying the airport,

00:08:35.559 --> 00:08:37.890
we have to go to the battlefield together.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.000
I like the sound of that.

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:52.600
Brothers.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.200
This airport

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.400
was lost by our Independent Brigade.

00:08:58.840 --> 00:09:01.000
This is a great humiliation for us.

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:04.080
So today, no matter what,

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.000
we must blow it up.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.400
We can't leave it to the enemy to harm our compatriots.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.130
Understand?

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:13.000
Understood.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.240
Brothers.

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:16.690
In a moment, we will cooperate,

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:17.760
attack together,

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:19.360
and take down the airport in one fell swoop.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:20.320
Yes.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.040
Move out.

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:38.020
Move out. Let's go.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:15.560
Come, Old Xu.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:19.040
Hurry.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:02.680
Let's go.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:09.240
Brother.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:10.200
Master Liu.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.780
You are a step too late.

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:12.640
Tahara Masao

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.880
has already fled with the first batch of gold.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:16.360
We had no way to notify you.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.730
The only place he can go now is the airport.

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:21.200
Let's go after him together

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.200
to support Cai Baozi and Cui Wenkui.

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:25.560
Master Liu, you lead the men

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:27.810
to evacuate the civilians safely.

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:28.740
Go in 200 meters

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:30.640
and put more explosives at the bottom of the lake

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:31.440
to blow through the lake bottom.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:32.240
Okay.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:34.280
Master Liu,

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:35.920
take care.

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:37.600
Brother,

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.720
let's make it out alive.

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:41.600
Explosives.

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:45.840
Follow me.

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:47.080
Let's go.

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.120
Brothers, get in the car.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.080
Retreat.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.560
Report, Colonel.

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:21.160
Cui Wenkui's Independent Brigade

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:22.400
has launched a surprise attack on us.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.960
They have broken through the northwest checkpoint

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:26.090
and are heading for the headquarters.

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.640
They came really fast.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:31.080
Where are the Communist guerrillas?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.200
We just received news

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.320
that the Communist guerrillas

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:34.720
have captured Hama Cave.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.640
All the soldiers there have died for our country.

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:38.280
Only Major Tahara managed to escape.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:40.880
He is driving a military vehicle toward the airport now.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.200
Tahara is resourceful,

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.920
a truly outstanding soldier of the Empire.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:46.840
Pass my order.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:50.640
All soldiers at the airport are to assemble in the northwest.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:52.800
Before Major Tahara returns,

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:55.440
we must annihilate the Independent Brigade

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:58.440
and ensure the safe landing of the transport plane.

00:13:58.760 --> 00:13:59.360
Colonel.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:01.480
The Independent Brigade is very close to you now.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.800
Do you want to hide?

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:06.880
I won't run away.

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.480
I must meet them.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.010
There's no one here.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.330
Brigade Commander, the room is empty.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.740
Captain, there's no one here either.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:33.680
Impossible.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.680
My men have been keeping an eye on Matsui.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:37.880
They said he's been at the airport these two days

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:38.560
and hasn't moved at all.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:40.820
He couldn't have vanished into thin air.

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:44.840
Oh no.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.200
It's a trap. Retreat quickly.

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:48.880
Everyone, retreat.

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.440
Take cover. Everyone, take cover.

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:55.770
Take cover. Take cover.

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:13.320
Brigade Commander Cui.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.480
Brigade Commander Cui.

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:17.120
I knew you would attack my airport.

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:20.160
I knew you would attack our airport.

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:23.200
Mr. Tahara specifically designed

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.330
an empty fort strategy for you.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.500
It is Mr. Tahara who

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.880
understands you Chinese well.

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:31.500
Brigade Commander Cui, stop resisting.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:33.720
Just surrender your weapons.

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:35.800
Don't resist anymore in this battle.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:36.920
Just surrender your weapons.

00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:37.960
You know nothing.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.960
Since the day I was born,

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.260
I've never known the word surrender.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:47.280
You Chinese are so stubborn.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.640
Resistance means death.

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:53.040
Fire!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.200
Driving makes us too big a target. Let's get out.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.260
Everyone, get out!

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.300
Judging by the explosion,

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:30.370
Baozi and your brother succeeded.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:31.760
Not necessarily.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:32.520
The explosion is mixed with

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:34.250
the sound of a fierce gunfight.

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:35.520
If they had succeeded,

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:37.320
the enemy wouldn't be interfering with them anymore.

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:38.250
So you're saying

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:40.120
that's the sound of the enemy's heavy weapons.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:41.200
Highly likely.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.100
Let's hurry and support them. Go.

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:45.520
Go, go, go.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.000
Baozi.

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:03.720
Cai Baozi.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.619
Do you see those oil tanks?

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:10.880
We must blow them up.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:15.130
But the enemy's attack is too strong and their firepower is too fierce.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:16.040
So,

00:17:17.119 --> 00:17:18.579
we just have to fight hard.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:23.530
Everything is just as Major Tahara expected.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:25.020
The Communist guerrillas

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.960
and Cui Wenkui's Independent Brigade.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:28.280
They have been heavily surrounded

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.600
by Colonel Matsui's firepower.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:32.360
Their demise is only a matter of time.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.200
I just didn't expect

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.520
they could last this long.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.240
The reason I anticipated the enemy's moves

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.600
is that I never underestimated this force.

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:42.930
They are brave in battle

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:44.480
and cunning as foxes.

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.960
They are beyond comparison to Zhang Gongyan's troops.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:49.240
They are the real opponents of the Empire of Japan,

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:50.960
the stumbling block for our Westward Plan.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:51.760
Yes.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.960
Major, it's getting late.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.840
The transport plane from Fuyang is arriving soon.

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.370
We need to depart immediately to rendezvous.

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:22.800
Get the explosive packs!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.120
Covering fire!

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:25.560
Charge!

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:27.400
Go!

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:01.120
Our planes have arrived.

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:03.280
It's too late. I'll go.

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:04.280
What are you doing?

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.810
We agreed to stay together.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:07.600
The airport was lost on my watch.

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.160
I'll take it back myself.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:10.810
Listen to me.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.360
If anything happens to me,

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.220
I leave my brothers in your hands.

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.800
Cui Wenkui, I don't care about this.

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:18.400
You lead them yourself.

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:20.600
Baozi,

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:22.480
about your father,

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.040
I'm sorry.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:26.680
Cui Wenkui,

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:29.160
don't forget you have a sister.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:31.240
So I have to do something

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:33.000
to make my sister proud.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.280
Cui Wenkui!

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:39.320
Covering fire!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:58.160
Wenkui.

00:19:58.320 --> 00:19:59.680
Cui Wenkui.

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:17.400
Why don't I see

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.040
Tahara Masao's gold transport truck?

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.200
Leave it for now. Saving people is more important.

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:21.240
Let's rush over.

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:22.280
Charge!

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:33.780
Get ready to leave.

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:35.680
Head straight to Fuyang.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.120
What? To Fuyang?

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:40.650
Aren't we going to the airport?

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.210
Everyone knows we're going to the airport

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:47.050
and about the transport plane carrying the gold.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:50.440
So why should we still go?

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:53.040
But Colonel Matsui is waiting for us.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:55.640
He has already controlled the whole situation.

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:58.040
Although Colonel Matsui surrounded them,

00:20:58.280 --> 00:21:01.120
their target is still this truck of gold.

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:02.690
As long as we show up,

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.320
they will stop at nothing

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:06.280
to snatch this gold.

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:07.440
I see.

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:09.380
You are brilliant, Major.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.600
However, Colonel Matsui and the others...

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.200
We can't let this gold

00:21:15.440 --> 00:21:16.840
face any more accidents.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.960
Serving the Great Japanese Empire,

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.360
we won't hesitate to sacrifice our lives.

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:21.920
Nothing else matters.

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:24.650
Let Colonel Matsui draw their fire there.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:26.480
We'll detour to Fuyang.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.000
As long as we safely deliver this gold

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:29.920
to General Kurokawa,

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:31.680
it's a great merit.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:33.520
Any personal loss

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:37.000
is nothing compared to the glory of this achievement.

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:38.560
I believe

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:41.960
Colonel Matsui will understand.

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:42.920
Yes.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.200
For the so-called holy war,

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:47.840
innocent lives can be sacrificed,

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:51.210
and you can even betray your own compatriots.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:53.600
With a victory like this,

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:56.570
do you have a clear conscience?

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:00.320
He Xiaobian.

00:22:52.400 --> 00:22:53.520
Grenade!

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:55.240
Grenade!

00:23:51.720 --> 00:23:52.520
Brother!

00:23:53.520 --> 00:23:54.280
Brother!

00:23:54.480 --> 00:23:55.610
Come back, brother!

00:23:55.680 --> 00:23:56.480
Don't pull me!

00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:57.440
Brother, come back!

00:23:57.440 --> 00:23:58.280
Brother!

00:23:59.200 --> 00:23:59.960
Brother!

00:24:00.280 --> 00:24:01.240
Brother!

00:24:03.640 --> 00:24:04.760
Let go of me!

00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:06.720
Brother!

00:24:58.880 --> 00:25:00.240
Brother.

00:25:44.160 --> 00:25:47.400
Brother.

00:25:57.920 --> 00:25:59.320
Shoot!

00:26:18.880 --> 00:26:20.720
You are quite loyal

00:26:20.960 --> 00:26:22.520
to our Great Japanese Empire.

00:26:22.520 --> 00:26:23.320
Yes.

00:26:23.600 --> 00:26:24.720
So loyal.

00:26:26.000 --> 00:26:27.440
Loyal enough to cost me

00:26:27.680 --> 00:26:29.000
my wife and daughter.

00:26:30.960 --> 00:26:32.160
I came here today

00:26:33.200 --> 00:26:34.880
to seek justice from you.

00:26:35.600 --> 00:26:37.040
Seek justice from me?

00:26:38.880 --> 00:26:39.920
Nonsense.

00:26:40.800 --> 00:26:43.280
You are just a dog raised by us Japanese.

00:26:43.640 --> 00:26:45.440
Right now, the whole of China

00:26:45.480 --> 00:26:47.120
will belong to us Japanese.

00:26:47.440 --> 00:26:50.360
You can only make a living by following us.

00:26:50.920 --> 00:26:52.000
Other than that,

00:26:52.680 --> 00:26:54.360
do you have any other choice?

00:26:55.280 --> 00:26:57.120
You killed my wife

00:26:57.560 --> 00:26:58.760
and my daughter.

00:27:00.400 --> 00:27:03.360
You killed the boss who was incredibly kind to me.

00:27:04.160 --> 00:27:06.880
How will this blood debt be settled?

00:27:08.440 --> 00:27:10.640
China has accumulated deep-seated problems for decades,

00:27:10.640 --> 00:27:12.760
like a dying old man.

00:27:13.120 --> 00:27:14.880
While our Great Japanese Empire

00:27:14.880 --> 00:27:17.280
is like the rising sun illuminating everywhere.

00:27:17.280 --> 00:27:19.640
Replacing it is the general trend.

00:27:19.960 --> 00:27:21.440
This is natural justice.

00:27:21.920 --> 00:27:24.160
Those who are stubborn

00:27:24.600 --> 00:27:26.730
and unwilling to be obedient subjects

00:27:27.120 --> 00:27:29.320
bring death upon themselves.

00:27:32.480 --> 00:27:35.480
No matter how nice you make your heinous crimes sound,

00:27:36.200 --> 00:27:38.840
it doesn't hide your beastly nature.

00:27:39.680 --> 00:27:42.680
Now you want to plunder our gold.

00:27:43.640 --> 00:27:45.160
You are simply dreaming.

00:27:45.160 --> 00:27:46.490
I won't let you succeed.

00:27:47.560 --> 00:27:48.480
Is that so?

00:27:50.320 --> 00:27:51.640
Just you?

00:27:53.360 --> 00:27:54.680
Just by me, this dog.

00:27:55.560 --> 00:27:59.000
I was willing to be your dog before

00:27:59.640 --> 00:28:03.100
because I was worried about the safety of my wife and daughter.

00:28:03.240 --> 00:28:04.200
Now,

00:28:04.800 --> 00:28:06.660
they have both been killed by you.

00:28:07.720 --> 00:28:09.800
I have no more concerns.

00:28:14.520 --> 00:28:15.760
Mr. He.

00:28:16.840 --> 00:28:18.400
Please believe me.

00:28:19.000 --> 00:28:20.640
Our Great Japanese Imperial Army

00:28:20.640 --> 00:28:22.840
will definitely treat you well.

00:28:24.000 --> 00:28:25.320
Come with me to Fuyang.

00:28:25.840 --> 00:28:27.800
There are many beautiful women waiting.

00:28:27.800 --> 00:28:28.720
By then,

00:28:29.280 --> 00:28:32.000
won't you have a wife and children all the same?

00:28:33.440 --> 00:28:35.500
When my wife and daughter were alive,

00:28:36.240 --> 00:28:38.100
Everyone wants me to be a good man.

00:28:39.000 --> 00:28:40.600
But I have never managed it.

00:28:41.560 --> 00:28:44.760
I have been living in constant guilt and anxiety all day long.

00:28:44.760 --> 00:28:46.760
But today, I did it.

00:28:48.240 --> 00:28:50.000
I can finally face them

00:28:50.000 --> 00:28:51.400
with a clear conscience.

00:28:55.960 --> 00:28:56.920
No.

00:28:57.400 --> 00:28:58.720
No.

00:29:16.400 --> 00:29:19.000
Charge.

00:29:19.320 --> 00:29:20.720
Fire.

00:29:21.800 --> 00:29:25.880
Comrades, charge.

00:29:28.560 --> 00:29:30.520
Attack.

00:29:34.800 --> 00:29:35.920
Colonel, go.

00:29:36.400 --> 00:29:37.480
Colonel.

00:30:15.600 --> 00:30:17.000
We will not stop.

00:30:17.720 --> 00:30:19.560
You Chinese are all crazy.

00:30:21.720 --> 00:30:23.240
Tian Yuan is coming soon.

00:30:23.600 --> 00:30:25.240
You will all die.

00:31:47.520 --> 00:31:50.160
The flames of war engulfed Sandao Yuan.

00:31:50.160 --> 00:31:52.160
Heroic children protected their homeland.

00:31:52.160 --> 00:31:54.080
People united for the anti-Japanese cause.

00:31:54.080 --> 00:31:56.410
Fearing neither sacrifice nor hardship.

00:32:00.120 --> 00:32:03.040
The enemies' dream of marching west was shattered.

00:32:04.960 --> 00:32:11.480
They were finished in western Henan.

00:32:36.680 --> 00:32:39.520
Generals fell, and heroes passed away.

00:32:40.120 --> 00:32:41.840
It is truly a pity.

00:32:42.480 --> 00:32:44.080
My eldest brother used to say

00:32:45.120 --> 00:32:47.650
that soldiers should die on the battlefield.

00:32:51.320 --> 00:32:53.280
Now, he died a worthy death.

00:32:53.880 --> 00:32:55.610
Before Cui Wenkui passed away,

00:32:55.640 --> 00:32:58.100
he entrusted his independent brigade to me,

00:32:58.320 --> 00:32:59.520
asking me to lead them

00:32:59.520 --> 00:33:02.120
to continue participating in the anti-Japanese actions.

00:33:02.120 --> 00:33:05.560
Then don't disappoint him.

00:33:06.280 --> 00:33:08.200
Integrate with the swordsmen

00:33:08.640 --> 00:33:11.170
and unify under the Independent Detachment.

00:33:11.280 --> 00:33:13.080
The independent brigade is also

00:33:13.080 --> 00:33:14.760
a strong force with rich combat experience.

00:33:14.760 --> 00:33:16.280
It will be of great help

00:33:16.560 --> 00:33:18.080
to your future anti-Japanese struggles.

00:33:18.080 --> 00:33:18.960
Yes.

00:33:19.440 --> 00:33:23.080
In addition, the commander of the military sub-district also entrusted me

00:33:23.080 --> 00:33:26.160
to commend your actions this time.

00:33:26.560 --> 00:33:27.960
He believes your success

00:33:28.280 --> 00:33:30.840
is primarily a victory in united front work.

00:33:31.280 --> 00:33:33.400
It not only attracted many patriotic armed forces

00:33:33.400 --> 00:33:34.320
to join us,

00:33:34.720 --> 00:33:37.560
but also made some traitors working for the Japanese

00:33:37.560 --> 00:33:38.690
turn over a new leaf.

00:33:38.920 --> 00:33:41.000
It strategically isolated the Japanese

00:33:41.000 --> 00:33:43.080
and completely shattered their dream

00:33:43.080 --> 00:33:44.600
of transporting gold.

00:33:45.800 --> 00:33:48.040
Especially Comrade Shangguan Ying

00:33:48.440 --> 00:33:49.970
and Comrade Yuanshangfei,

00:33:50.160 --> 00:33:51.890
who performed outstandingly.

00:33:53.160 --> 00:33:54.760
Because of your patriotism,

00:33:55.000 --> 00:33:56.880
the Japanese were plunged into

00:33:56.880 --> 00:33:58.810
the vast ocean of our people's war.

00:33:59.120 --> 00:34:02.640
A hundred thousand swordsmen, like a hundred thousand steel swords,

00:34:02.640 --> 00:34:06.040
ruthlessly sent Matsui

00:34:06.360 --> 00:34:07.960
and Tahara, the two old devils who harmed the Chinese people,

00:34:07.960 --> 00:34:10.679
to the guillotine and the road to the netherworld.

00:34:10.679 --> 00:34:12.400
Thank you for the commanders' encouragement.

00:34:12.400 --> 00:34:14.320
It is our duty and obligation.

00:34:15.800 --> 00:34:18.600
Based on the smooth development of the anti-Japanese situation,

00:34:18.600 --> 00:34:19.560
our troops

00:34:20.000 --> 00:34:22.719
will soon advance south of Luoyang.

00:34:23.239 --> 00:34:24.239
We will establish

00:34:24.800 --> 00:34:26.520
a new strategic area there.

00:34:26.760 --> 00:34:28.320
We will conduct harassment and blocking battles

00:34:28.320 --> 00:34:30.320
against the main force of the Japanese,

00:34:30.320 --> 00:34:34.120
fundamentally delaying their westward advance to Hangu Pass.

00:34:34.480 --> 00:34:36.239
That's going right under Kurokawa's nose

00:34:36.239 --> 00:34:37.040
to raise hell.

00:34:37.320 --> 00:34:39.719
It feels thrilling just thinking about it.

00:34:40.440 --> 00:34:43.400
But I also bring bad news.

00:34:45.159 --> 00:34:46.560
You two good partners

00:34:47.239 --> 00:34:48.699
are going to be separated.

00:34:48.880 --> 00:34:50.520
The commander of the military sub-district

00:34:50.520 --> 00:34:53.719
highly values Comrade Cui Wenpei's experience behind enemy lines

00:34:53.719 --> 00:34:56.120
and decided to transfer Comrade Cui Wenpei

00:34:56.400 --> 00:34:58.080
to the enemy-occupied area in Luoyang

00:34:58.080 --> 00:35:01.040
to take charge of organization and united front work,

00:35:01.040 --> 00:35:04.600
cooperating with the troops to expand the anti-Japanese base area there.

00:35:04.600 --> 00:35:07.000
I firmly obey the superior's arrangement.

00:35:08.360 --> 00:35:09.360
I have no objection.

00:35:09.360 --> 00:35:11.200
Everything is for the overall situation of the anti-Japanese war.

00:35:11.200 --> 00:35:15.200
Later, Comrade Cui Wenpei will go with me

00:35:15.440 --> 00:35:17.080
to report to the military sub-district headquarters.

00:35:17.080 --> 00:35:18.960
If you have anything to say to each other,

00:35:18.960 --> 00:35:20.320
hurry up and say it.

00:35:21.040 --> 00:35:22.320
I won't delay you.

00:35:39.440 --> 00:35:40.280
Let's go.

00:35:47.640 --> 00:35:48.600
Brother.

00:35:49.400 --> 00:35:50.360
Let's go.

00:35:52.680 --> 00:35:53.640
Uncle Liu.

00:35:58.280 --> 00:35:59.320
Take care.

00:36:00.400 --> 00:36:01.360
Ying'er.

00:36:09.240 --> 00:36:10.720
You take care too.

00:36:11.400 --> 00:36:12.360
Take care.

00:36:22.880 --> 00:36:23.880
Brother Cai.

00:36:26.480 --> 00:36:27.960
Take care of yourselves.

00:36:28.280 --> 00:36:29.160
Take care.

00:36:36.080 --> 00:36:37.040
Commander.

00:36:38.000 --> 00:36:38.960
Let's go.

00:36:45.040 --> 00:36:46.960
We are all Eighth Route Army soldiers,

00:36:46.960 --> 00:36:48.290
devoted to our country.

00:36:48.680 --> 00:36:50.520
We've long been used to

00:36:50.840 --> 00:36:53.040
these temporary assignments and transfers.

00:36:53.040 --> 00:36:54.360
I just didn't expect

00:36:55.280 --> 00:36:56.880
this parting to come so soon.

00:36:57.320 --> 00:36:58.980
When I first came to Shanzhou,

00:36:59.840 --> 00:37:01.840
I never thought I'd meet you either,

00:37:03.800 --> 00:37:06.400
let alone fight the Japanese together.

00:37:09.840 --> 00:37:11.240
I'm already content.

00:37:11.640 --> 00:37:13.280
Perhaps in these troubled times,

00:37:13.280 --> 00:37:16.120
being together is a luxury in itself.

00:37:16.760 --> 00:37:18.680
Only when we drive out the invaders

00:37:18.680 --> 00:37:20.840
will we have a true reunion.

00:37:22.120 --> 00:37:23.680
When peace is restored,

00:37:24.320 --> 00:37:26.180
we'll go back to Beiping together

00:37:27.160 --> 00:37:28.820
to fulfill my brother's wish.

00:37:29.000 --> 00:37:30.040
It's a deal.

00:37:30.480 --> 00:37:31.520
It's a deal.

00:37:36.880 --> 00:37:38.560
I won't take up any more of your time.

00:37:38.560 --> 00:37:41.080
There are others waiting to say goodbye.

00:37:43.040 --> 00:37:43.920
Wenpei.

00:37:45.600 --> 00:37:46.520
Take care.

00:38:03.320 --> 00:38:04.360
I'm leaving.

00:38:08.000 --> 00:38:09.920
Do you have anything to say to me?

00:38:11.000 --> 00:38:11.880
I...

00:38:13.080 --> 00:38:14.560
I don't know what to say.

00:38:20.280 --> 00:38:21.960
Do you want to come with me?

00:38:24.120 --> 00:38:25.200
Of course I do.

00:38:25.640 --> 00:38:26.970
I promised your brother

00:38:27.400 --> 00:38:28.920
to protect you for the rest of my life.

00:38:28.920 --> 00:38:30.320
As long as you don't mind,

00:38:30.640 --> 00:38:31.570
wherever you go,

00:38:31.880 --> 00:38:33.610
I, Yuanshangfei, will follow.

00:38:34.080 --> 00:38:35.400
In life and death.

00:38:40.160 --> 00:38:41.840
You finally said it.

00:38:43.400 --> 00:38:44.330
Comrade Wenpei.

00:38:44.520 --> 00:38:46.400
Yuanshangfei may be clumsy with words,

00:38:46.400 --> 00:38:47.660
but he has a warm heart.

00:38:47.760 --> 00:38:48.960
Please bear with him

00:38:49.480 --> 00:38:50.800
and treat him well.

00:38:51.960 --> 00:38:54.560
I'll leave my work in your hands from now on.

00:38:55.240 --> 00:38:56.160
Don't worry.

00:38:57.160 --> 00:38:59.600
I'll do my best to keep everything in order

00:39:00.040 --> 00:39:01.200
and learn from you.

00:39:04.720 --> 00:39:05.640
Farewell.

00:39:08.280 --> 00:39:10.280
Miss, take care.

00:39:12.040 --> 00:39:12.840
Baozi.

00:39:13.200 --> 00:39:14.560
Treat her well.

00:39:15.520 --> 00:39:16.720
You take care too.

00:39:34.760 --> 00:39:35.680
Wenpei.

00:39:36.360 --> 00:39:37.240
Yuanshangfei.

00:39:56.480 --> 00:39:57.320
Baozi,

00:39:58.080 --> 00:40:01.480
will we ever meet them again?

00:40:02.880 --> 00:40:03.920
Definitely.

00:40:05.080 --> 00:40:06.960
The day we win the war

00:40:08.560 --> 00:40:10.200
is the day we reunite.

00:40:17.600 --> 00:40:18.800
Chief.

00:40:19.920 --> 00:40:21.080
I am leaving.

00:40:22.760 --> 00:40:26.440
I have taken the swordsmen and Ying'er with me.

00:40:27.520 --> 00:40:28.840
Ying'er is with me.

00:40:29.400 --> 00:40:31.120
I will take good care of her.

00:40:32.600 --> 00:40:34.240
Please rest assured.

00:40:37.360 --> 00:40:40.880
Our swordsmen have now joined the Eighth Route Army.

00:40:42.440 --> 00:40:44.000
We will not let you

00:40:44.560 --> 00:40:46.280
or our fallen brothers down.

00:40:47.080 --> 00:40:48.360
Baozi and I

00:40:49.080 --> 00:40:51.410
will definitely fulfill your dying wish.

00:40:57.120 --> 00:40:58.960
When the day of victory comes,

00:40:59.520 --> 00:41:01.520
we will come back to see you.